{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14107","headline":"赠岑郎中 · 戎昱","name":"赠岑郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童年未解读书时，诵得郎中数首诗。\n四海烟尘犹隔阔，十年魂梦每相随。\n虽披云雾逢迎疾，已恨趋风拜德迟。\n天下无人鉴诗句，不寻诗伯重寻谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}